        <gr str="2532">and </gr>
        <gr str="1783">prayer</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">If thou shalt <gr str="5294 ">put </gr>the <gr str="80">brethren </gr>in <gr str="5294">remembrance </gr>of these <gr str="5023">things</gr>, thou shalt <gr str="2071">be </gr>a <gr str="2570">good </gr>
