      <VERS vnumber="16">Take <gr str="1907">heed </gr>to <gr str="4572">thyself</gr>, <gr str="2532">and </gr>to thy <gr str="1319">doctrine</gr>; <gr str="1961">continue </gr>in <gr str="846">them</gr>: <gr str="1063">for </gr>in <gr str="4160">doing </gr>
